      "text": "舞台危机\n三幕交锋；阻止破坏并判断真正目标。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "theatre-crisis",
      "originalText": "舞台危机\n三幕交锋；阻止破坏并判断真正目标。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
